  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Pro Line Rough is a tournament-oriented co-polyester monofilament developed from decades of string manufacturing experience. Its textured surface enhances ball bite and spin while maintaining a strong balance of power and directional control. The string is engineered for consistent dynamic response and excellent tension maintenance, giving competitive players predictable performance throughout play. The 1.20 mm version emphasizes spin and feel, the 1.25 mm version provides the best all-around balance, and the 1.30 mm version maximizes durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Pro Line Rough 是一款面向竞技与比赛球员的共聚酯单丝球线，基于 Kirschbaum 多年的球线制造经验开发。特殊纹理表面能够增强咬球与旋转，同时在力量和精准控制之间保持出色平衡。其核心优势之一是稳定的动态反馈与优秀保磅能力，让球员在较长时间内获得一致、可预测的击球表现。1.20毫米版本更强调旋转和手感；1.25毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30毫米版本则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

